{"version":1,"content":"<p>巴西總統盧拉周日（25日）擊敗前總統博索納羅之子弗拉維奧（Flávio Bolsonaro），成功連任。</p><p>選舉法院宣布，盧拉以51.8%得票擊敗48.2%的弗拉維奧。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:55.710317+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T00:31:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:15.568969+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:06.563822+00:00","content_hash":"0035fdbc63cb4ad7995bb4779717143ccd1a0e416291dcf3a004c84745da2511","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}